，約HK$135）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6db30b71cd1248c5a7d475df4a3be00d/2026-04/40_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"整體評分：4.46\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a3258e830a793884ec18d3c8d10dceb/2026-04/41_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"這款產品蘊含源自魚子醬、黑酵母和黑蘿蔔的PDRN成分，在保濕測試中展現出卓越的保濕功效，有效提升肌膚含水量。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4126921aa0623c4ef7f0650f411da88e/2026-04/42_1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-29T07:20:19.462724+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1719,"images":82,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}